		<r3d:repositoryName language="eng">NASA GEWEX Surface Radiation Budget</r3d:repositoryName>
				<r3d:additionalName language="eng">NASA GEWEX SRB</r3d:additionalName>
				<r3d:repositoryUrl>https://asdc.larc.nasa.gov/project/SRB</r3d:repositoryUrl>
				<r3d:description language="eng">The NASA/GEWEX SRB project is a major component of the GEWEX radiation research. The objective of the NASA/GEWEX SRB project is to determine surface, top-of-atmosphere (TOA), and atmospheric shortwave (SW) and longwave (LW) radiative fluxes with the precision needed to predict transient climate variations and decadal-to-centennial climate trends.</r3d:description>
